[step] Local functional mold-opening clearance: the 1 mm recess admits a thin blunt separation blade at the clamped parting edge.
alternatives: Deleting the entry removes controlled opening access. A 3 mm entry would leave 2 mm beneath it in the 5 mm flange and change the intended tool opening.
