[ceiling] Functional flat bearing for the M4 clamp washers and bolt heads at eight stations. The mold recipe assigns support to these faces; the side and downward access remain open. Current support placement and removal need the tooling's fresh production slice.
alternatives: A sloping bearing tilts the flat washer. Closing the access prevents fitting and holding the bolt head. Keep the required bearing and its accessible supported print face.
